### Register a new Klienta
POST http://localhost:8080/clients/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idKlienta": null,
  "imie": "Fufix",
  "nazwisko": "Gnufix",
  "nrTelefonu": "777777777",
  "plec": "M",
  "idSalonu": 1,
  "idAdresu": 5
}

